 * the runtime role neither owns them nor holds `TRUNCATE`, is provisioning — `scripts/dev/provision-test-database.sh`
 * for the test cluster and `infra/README.md` for a deployment. A migration runs AS the owner, so a migration that
 * granted the runtime role its own privileges would be the owner deciding its own security policy, and the
